      <marc:subfield code="a">Roar! Roar! Baby Dinosaur allows kids to find out about dinosaurs in a lively, unique way. Learning becomes noisy fun as dinosaurs hide under 16 tactile flaps, 5 of which set off amazing light-activated sounds. Roar! Roar! Baby Dinosaur promotes hands-on learning while word labels develop vocabulary and pre-school knowledge. The delightful story is designed to be read aloud by a parent or carer and fun and repeated phrases allow little ones to join in, encouraging early learning. With a sparkly, touch-and-feel front cover and sturdy board format, this book is ideal for the inquisitive child. Vibrant and engaging, Roar! Roar! Baby Dinosaur will appeal to the imagination of preschoolers, making learning about the prehistoric fun and exciting</marc:subfield>
